--
--   sb.<district>.<n>   a line of the song, n = 1..C.songbook.pool (32). The SAME n means the same line in every
--                       language (a translation), because a save stores only n. 3-8 words, or one word; no real lyrics.
--   sbt.<district>.<n>  a title, n = 1..C.songbook.titles (16)
--
-- To add lines: append n = 33, 34 ... for EVERY district and raise C.songbook.pool in meta/config.lua (a line
-- added at the end never changes a song that is already written); docs/handoff/WP-9.md.
-- A title is picked from the lines of the song; tests/meta/songbook_test.lua checks the counts and the languages.

